Subject: [M156] Guard against re-entrant destruction of the CJS_Runtime

Original change's description:
> Guard against re-entrant destruction of the CJS_Runtime
>
> Prevent a (somewhat) misbehaving embedder from tearing down the
> runtime while a callback is still in-flight.
>
